{
  "about": [
    "Route vectors for GET <ws>/events?window=<windowId> (the SSE stream: hello, batch, inactive, a ping every 15 s).",
    "Authored in canopy (tests/canopy_mcp/fixtures/workspace/); every other holder keeps a byte-identical copy of the whole directory.",
    "ASCII-only, no trailing whitespace, exactly one final newline.",
    "Route vectors for the workspace's HTTP surface on FRONT. path is relative to the advertised workspace path (config.json workspace.path); there is no route that accepts commands.",
    "Each case: setup steps (the scenarios' step grammar, on a fresh hub with epoch e1 and the clock at 0), one request {method, path, headers?, body?, padTo?}, expect {status, body?, events?}, then optional follow-up steps.",
    "A body {'$file': <name>} is that fixture file's body (state.sample.json, state.oversize.json, state.reduced.json); state '$sample' / '$empty' as in the scenarios. padTo: once those are resolved, the body's compact JSON followed by spaces up to that many bytes.",
    "A claim or report body is {windowId, seq, shown, state, truncated?}; truncated is true when the window reduced an oversize state. An error body is {code, detail}; expect names the code only.",
    "Every workspace route, the event stream included, refuses a Sec-Fetch-Site that is present and neither same-origin nor none with 403 cross_site, before it reads the body or the hub.",
    "Bodies are at most 131072 bytes (413 too_large); a state that breaks the hub's normalisation is 422 invalid_state.",
    "events: the events the stream delivers at once, pings left out."
  ],
  "route": "events",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "the active window gets hello",
      "setup": [
        {
          "actor": "window:A",
          "do": "claim",
          "seq": 41,
          "shown": true,
          "state": "$sample",
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "body": {
              "active": true,
              "previous": null,
              "epoch": "e1"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "events?window=w-A"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "events": [
          {
            "event": "hello",
            "data": {
              "epoch": "e1",
              "activeWindow": "w-A",
              "seq": 41
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a window that does not hold the slot gets 204",
      "setup": [
        {
          "actor": "window:A",
          "do": "claim",
          "seq": 41,
          "shown": true,
          "state": "$sample",
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "body": {
              "active": true,
              "previous": null,
              "epoch": "e1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "window:A",
          "do": "connect",
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "events": [
              {
                "event": "hello",
                "data": {
                  "epoch": "e1",
                  "activeWindow": "w-A",
                  "seq": 41
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "events?window=w-B"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 204
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "no window holds the slot",
      "setup": [],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "events?window=w-A"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 204
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a second stream replaces the first without window_gone",
      "setup": [
        {
          "actor": "window:A",
          "do": "claim",
          "seq": 41,
          "shown": true,
          "state": "$sample",
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "body": {
              "active": true,
              "previous": null,
              "epoch": "e1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "window:A",
          "do": "connect",
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "events": [
              {
                "event": "hello",
                "data": {
                  "epoch": "e1",
                  "activeWindow": "w-A",
                  "seq": 41
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "do": "set_workspace",
          "commands": [
            {
              "cmd": "focus",
              "args": {
                "key": "library/linac/LinacView?SR=1"
              }
            }
          ],
          "wait_s": 0,
          "expect": {
            "batch": {
              "id": "b-e1-1",
              "status": "pending",
              "results": []
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "actor": "window:A",
          "do": "receive",
          "expect": {
            "events": [
              {
                "event": "batch",
                "data": {
                  "batch": "b-e1-1",
                  "window": "w-A",
                  "commands": [
                    {
                      "id": "c-e1-1",
                      "cmd": "focus",
                      "args": {
                        "key": "library/linac/LinacView?SR=1"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "events?window=w-A"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "events": [
          {
            "event": "hello",
            "data": {
              "epoch": "e1",
              "activeWindow": "w-A",
              "seq": 41
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "then": [
        {
          "actor": "clock",
          "do": "advance",
          "ms": 5000
        },
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "do": "set_workspace",
          "commands": [
            {
              "cmd": "focus",
              "args": {
                "key": "library/linac/LinacView?SR=1"
              }
            }
          ],
          "batch_id": "b-e1-1",
          "wait_s": 0,
          "expect": {
            "batch": {
              "id": "b-e1-1",
              "status": "pending",
              "results": []
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a cross-site stream",
      "setup": [
        {
          "actor": "window:A",
          "do": "claim",
          "seq": 41,
          "shown": true,
          "state": "$sample",
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "body": {
              "active": true,
              "previous": null,
              "epoch": "e1"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "events?window=w-A",
        "headers": {
          "Sec-Fetch-Site": "cross-site"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 403,
        "body": {
          "code": "cross_site"
        }
      },
      "then": [
        {
          "actor": "agent",
          "do": "get_workspace",
          "expect": {
            "connected": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
